window.products.push({"id":1129098,"name":"Human Touch Perfect Chair Wedge Spanner Table in Black Ash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21K0eRF4BOL._AC_.jpg","description":"Just like its little brother, the Side Accessory Table, the Wedge Spanner Table comes in three wooden finishes to match your chairs – walnut, dark walnut and maple. The table is, of course, wedge shaped, so the chairs connected by it will be at a slight angle to each other and not precisely parallel. This angle is actually calculated for the home theater setting, so that every recliner chair is facing the screen directly. The table itself is two-level – the lower shelf is designed for storing small items, such as books and magazines, and the top can be used for items of immediate need, such as snacks, beverages or a remote control. For an ultimate home theater setting, join an arc of Perfect Chair recliners together, sit down and enjoy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21K0eRF4BOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Human Touch","source_asin":"B000LSRPMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000LSRPMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000LSRPMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1129099,"name":"Pregnancy Pillow Wedge for Maternity ，Side Sleeper Pregnancy Pillow Support Body, Belly, Back, Knees","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-y41k1GcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"About this item Hollow cotton，filled with 100% polyester fiber Item LxWxH：27 x 14 x 4 inches Stretch panel keeps the pillows in place as your bump grows. Perfect support for your back and baby bump while side sleeping. Enjoy stability and comfort as you nestle between 2 connected pillows. Compact design allows you to sleep comfortably and protect the fecus even while traveling. Versatile little supporter helps you get comfy while sleeping, but also while lounging or sitting. Comfort that lasts from pregnancy through postpartum recovery. Machine washable pillow,multiple colors to choose ,filled with 100% polyester fiber, ensures durability and reliable support. 100% money back guarantee: no strings attached. Just contact us and we will make sure you are 100% satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-y41k1GcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEILORI","source_asin":"B07MR26Z43","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MR26Z43","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MR26Z43","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1129100,"name":"Indonesian Light Colored Petrified Wood Bookends 4-6 Pounds 6-8 Inches High","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.06,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Uieh0yvmL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Petrified wood consists of fossil wood where all the organic materials have been replaced with minerals while retaining the original structure of the wood. The petrifaction process occurs underground when wood becomes buried under sediment and is initially preserved due to a lack of oxygen. Mineral-rich water flowing through the sediment deposits its minerals in the plant`s cells, and as the plant`s lignin and cellulose decay away, a stone mold forms in its place. Petrified wood from Indonesia is from ancient teak (hardwood) trees that are approximately 20 million years old. Minerals present in the mud and water prior to and during the petrification process give it its color. These wonderful Indonesian petrified wood bookends are carved from the same fossilized trunk, so the color matches perfectly. These bookends have a very light color, ranging from cream to pink and light tan, due to manganese and silica deposits. While they match in color, each bookend is unique, and they may be differently sized due to the natural petrification process. They range from 6 to 8 inches in height, are about 3.5 to 4 in wide, and are 2.5 in thick. Each bookend weighs between 2 and 3 pounds. NOTE: Because these are naturally made and unique, yours may not look exactly like the ones in the photographs shown.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Uieh0yvmL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Things2Die4","source_asin":"B00I9JNQ6O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I9JNQ6O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I9JNQ6O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
