window.products.push({"id":1129268,"name":"LINSY HOME Loveseat Sofa, 68'' Small Sofa with 2 USB Charging Ports, 2 Seat Loveseat Couch for Small Spaces, Living Room, Cushion Covers Removable, To","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812SUZYzmmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【All-in-One Functional Sofa】LINSY HOME All-in-one functional loveseat : 1. 20'' high back cushions provide more support; 2. Adjustable armrests expand the length of the sofa for better sleep; 3. Truly easy to clean because all seat and back cushion covers are removable; 4. Incredibly life-convenient features with two USB ports. It's worthwhile to pay more for a sofa that is more functional, cute and easier to clean 【Adjustable Armrest】 When the armrest is vertical, it is suitable for resting the arm; when half-opened, it is suitable for lying on the sofa to read or play with the mobile phone; when fully opened, the length of the couch is extended by 10 inches, perfect for sleeping. Always be comfortable, whether sitting or lying down. Our goal is to make the most of the small sofa for the small spaces 【USB Charging Ports】Like everything we have done, our loveseat has incredibly life-convenient features you expect, starting with two built-in USB ports. No need to worry about your phone running out of power while lying down on the sofa playing games. It is a genius match with the reclining armrest 【Easy-to-Clean Loveseat】 LINSY HOME love seat couch is the kind of the sofa that all cushion covers are removable for washing with zippers on the back 【High Back Cushions】 There are very few high-back loveseats on the market, but most consumers do want high-back styles, so we designed this high-back loveseat to fill the market vacancy. The height of the back cushion is 20'', which can provide much support for your back. (please note that it varies based on height) 【Tools Free Assembly】 All parts and instructions are packed into 2 boxes, which may be delivered at different times. The two seat sofa is easy to assemble even for elderly. Ideal for small spaces such as living room, bedroom, bedside, game room, etc. 【About the Package】 The maximum capacity of small loveseat is 450lb. The sofa set comes in 2 boxes, may be delivered at different times. What we want to do is to make our product worth the money, If there are any questions about the 2nd tracking number or the product, please feel free to contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812SUZYzmmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINSY HOME","source_asin":"B0BC24SFDX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC24SFDX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC24SFDX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
