window.products.push({"id":1129273,"name":"2 Slice Toaster, Retro Bread Toaster with LED Digital Countdown Timer, Extra Wide Slots Toasters with 6 Bread Shade Settings, Bagel, Cancel, Defrost F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EO8y1hzFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AMASTE TOASTER BLENDS RETRO AND MODERN STYLES. With Retro-style and trendy color options, the 2 slice toaster adds pizazz to any kitchen. If you've got a amaste retro coffee maker in your home, this tow-slot toaster will match beautifully. The modern LED digital countdown timer is a helpful, user-friendly function, it will show your selected toast settings and the toasting progress. The high lift lever will pop up automatically after the toast is done, which can help you easily take the bread. UNIQUE GIFT IDEA THEY WON'T FORGET. The Retro toasters line come in a variety of colors: Matcha Green, Arabica Black, and Elegant White with Rose Gold, which is ideal for anyone who put careful thought into their house design and color scheme. The multi-functional function and modern design make the toaster 2 slices the best gift choice for any occasion, whether it's a birthday, Christmas, or Valentine's. Toasters are well wrapped in a beautiful gift box, you can spend no time on the package. DESIGNED TO MEET YOUR DIVERSE NEEDS. This bagel toaster has two extra-wide (1.5 inches) slots with self-centering guides to accommodate all kinds of tasty toasted treats, like toast, bagels, and English muffins, and it can handle both thick and thin toast slices. The bread toaster has 6 different browning levels for you to choose, your toasting needs will definitely be met. All of our products qualify for a 1-year warranty. Feel free to contact us at any time. WONDERFUL MEALS BEGIN WITH AMASTE RETRO BREAD TOASTER. 2 slice toaster has three modes (bagel, defrost and reheat) and a cancel button so you can interrupt the process if things are getting overly browned. The high power of 850W shortens the toast time and bakes evenly. Two slices of perfect, golden brown toast from the small toaster you can count on. Toaster 2 Slice comes with food-grade stainless steel, non-toxic, safe, and healthy. EASY OPERATION & CLEANING. Simply plug in the socket, put in the toast or bagel, press down the lever, select the baking setting you need, and under a few minutes to get golden brown toast. What’s more, the toaster's design also includes a high-lift lever for safe, easy retrieval of your toast. The removable crumb tray slides right out for easy cleaning. Anti-slip feet keep this firm on the counter and convenient cord storage at the base.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EO8y1hzFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amaste","source_asin":"B0BMVHPFRN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMVHPFRN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMVHPFRN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
