window.products.push({"id":1129343,"name":"REHOOPEX Mid Century Modern Dresser - 6 Drawer Dresser for Bedroom with Spacious Drawers, Wood Dressers with Metal Handles, Storage Chest of Drawers f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719+1VmpH1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The REHOOPEX 6 drawer dresser is the perfect solution to save space and store scattered and small gadgets it is a delicate design with a beautiful appearance and gives color to your life, made of high-quality particle board material, durable and non-toxic for your daily use. It features 6 spacious drawers that open smoothly, revealing ample space to tuck away spare linens, shirts, pants, and other wardrobe must-haves. The top leaves plenty of room to turn it into vanity and add a mirror, or display a table lamp and some framed photos. Features: This drawer dresser is made of high-quality material Elegant, fine workmanship, complete the look of any room in your home  Spacious drawers are easy to glide and pulled in Simple design makes this drawer dresser a perfect decoration for your home It is suitable for indoor use, likes family room, bedroom and living room Specifications: Material: Particle Board Color: Walnut Finish Overall Dimensions: 47.25\" W x 15.75\" D x 29.33\" H  Drawer Dimensions: 23.03\" W x 12.2\" D x 7.68\" H  Load Capacity : 100 lbs / 25 lbs Number of Drawers: 6 Drawers Comes In One Box. Packed in a single box with an approximate weight of 89lbs for your convenience. The less bulky packaging also means it will fit into any door and could be easily taken into your home, even when the space is limited. The packaging also fits nicely at the back of your vehicle so moving it to another office, apartment, or house becomes uncomplicated. Easy To Assemble. Spend only a little time assembling this storage organizer by following the simple and straightforward installation instructions found in the product manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719+1VmpH1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REHOOPEX","source_asin":"B09VS3T246","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VS3T246","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VS3T246","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1129344,"name":"Crystal Trading 4-Piece Bed Sheet Set - Dobby Stripe - 100% Cotton Sateen - 400 Thread Count (Twin, Ivory)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41v-EfErFXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Experience luxury like you've never felt before. This Crystal Trading Bed Sheet Set will bring your dreams to a whole new level. Slip between the covers and surround yourself in the sinful luxury that this bedding offers. Soft like cotton , this lightweight and breathable sheet set is crafted from 100% GSM material , making it ideal for use during any season. Add in delightfully soft, ultra-plush pillowcases , and you'll truly feel pampered. Plus, this wrinkle-resistant material is also and resistant to to ensure optimal comfort . This 4-piece sheet set comes in twin, full, queen and king sizes to accommodate all mattresses – each set includes a flat sheet, fitted sheet and two pillowcases except for the twin size which includes one pillowcase. For added comfort and a perfect fit, the fitted sheet features elastic all around with deep pockets that fit mattresses up to 15\" deep . To top it off, the sheets are soft and luxurious , boasting a long-lasting sheen in a sateen weave . A dobby stripe pattern creates increased visual appeal, bringing a touch of class to any bedroom space. It's available in a variety of beautiful colors – black, white, sage, light blue, burgundy, gold, silver, coffee and beige – to meet everyone’s needs. No matter which one you choose, when morning comes and the alarm clock goes off, you just might be tempted to crawl farther beneath these covers and try to pick up where your dreams left off!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41v-EfErFXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CrystalTowels","source_asin":"B00FN4EK5O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FN4EK5O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FN4EK5O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
