window.products.push({"id":1129400,"name":"Bencier Flannel Fleece Lightweight Solid Microfiber Breathable Soft Throw Blanket for Couch/Sofa/Bed (Ice Blue, 60\"×80\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WLQLG-+9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"BENCIER Our plush and luxurious throw blanket is super soft, durable, and lightweight. It's wrinkle and fade resistant doesn't shed, with no formaldehyde, no fluorescent bleacher, no plasticizer or any harmful substances. It is suitable for all seasons. With the design of the unique sutures, even when washed many times, the blanket is still firmed and durable. If you want an incredibly comfortable blanket, BENCIER Blanket is a choice you cannot miss. Feature: 1. Unique sutures design, premium detail craftsmanship, solid connections add durability. 2. Soft texture helps you sleep well through the night.  3. Simple yet classy design. It adds extra flavor to your decor and turns your room into an inviting space. Product Details: Material: 100% Microfiber Polyester Fabric, 330GSM Oversized: Two Sizes Available(50*60inches,60*80inches)Four Colors Available(Navy Blue, Grey, Coffee, Ice Blue) Versatile: Double-sided reversible design offers you different textures, smooth on one side and fuzzy on the other.Suitable for bedroom, Couch, Study Room, Office, Hospital, Driving, Travelling, Camping, Picnic, Backpacking, and Other settings Care Instruction: Machine Washable, Dry on Low Heat Perfect gift for any occasion Guaranteed Satisfaction If you are not happy with your throw blanket for any reason, please contact us at customer service at any time. We will refund your money back with no questions asked. Please Note 1. All dimensions are manually measured with a possible deviation of 1-2 cm. 2. The digital images are as accurate as possible. Actual colors may vary slightly due to differences in display settings and lightings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WLQLG-+9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bencier","source_asin":"B07FD373KR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FD373KR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FD373KR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
