window.products.push({"id":1129425,"name":"Umbra Mini Flip(R) Hook, Wall or Over-The-Door Mount, White/Nickel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ilImxNESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Flip(R) wall-mount multi-hook rack by Umbra boasts a clever design, each hook can be retracted when not in use, slipping neatly into a groove in the rail for a sleek look and space-saving functionality. Available in a range of finishes and sizes, this walnut/black five-hook model measures 20-inch by 3-inch by 1-inch and easily mounts to the wall with the included mounting hardware. Constructed of hardwood with nickel-plated cast-metal hooks. From the designer: \"I designed this product after the many house parties I attended where there was never enough space to hang jackets. This design works great in a long hallway or entrance. When not in use, the hooks fold up for a very clean look.\" Designed by David Quan for Umbra - original, modern, casual, functional and affordable design for the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ilImxNESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B010XG8IFE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010XG8IFE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010XG8IFE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
