window.products.push({"id":1129574,"name":"Faivykyd Texas Homesick Gift Box Set with Scented Candle, State Necklace, Jar of Texas Message, State Gifts Idea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817LVMXJ-zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you feel homesick, miss everything from the old days, your family, friends, places, even the small river that runs behind garden back home. Faivykyd homesick box set help you bring the best memory of hometown back. Gift That Can Bring You Home: This Homesick gift package Contains Texas state scented candle in a reusable glass bottle, Homesick Jar of Message, Texas shape necklace and State Greeting Card in an exquisitely design gift box with the size of 7.3 X 5.3 X 4.2 inches. Together these items help recall those lovely days in sweet hometown. When your friends want a Texas souvenir after a unforgettable trip, a farewell gift, or miss those day living in Texas, that’s a great gift idea for them! Specially Blend Scented Soy Candle: The longlasting scented soy candle with the capacity of 9oz can burn cleanly and evenly. Top note: vanilla, pine needles, lime, middle note: leather, cedarwood, bottom note: moss, musk, cyclamen. This specially blend scent help trip back in the time when you were enjoying your Texas life. It’s also a great ornament for home décor, bedroom, living room, kitchen, office, home improvement. Perfect Gift for Texian: The jar of message brings you back to Texas with those familiar slangs, proverbs and sayings, “Don’t mess with Texas”, “Everything is bigger is Texas”, “HOWDY”, “This ain’t my first rodeo”, let these letters little cute things remind you of those lovely old days in your hometown. Texas shape chain necklace jewelry, it is the Texas you can hold in your hand or near by heart whenever you want. Gift for Any Occasions: Best gift for mom, dad, son daughter, families, friends, colleagues, coworkers, whom leave their hometown for any reasons, make them feel connected with hometown. A perfect gift idea for birthday gift, mothers day, fathers day, thanksgiving day, Christmas, valentines day gift, housewarming, graduation, leaving gift for women or men.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817LVMXJ-zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Faivykyd","source_asin":"B0978RJFS7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0978RJFS7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0978RJFS7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
