window.products.push({"id":1129584,"name":"Mothers Day Gifts Cookbook Stand Wood Recipe Holder with Sturdy and Foldable for Pad Book as a Gifts for Moms Who Have Everything Gfits for Mommy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719MhrTL45L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Mother’s Day Gifts: As a custom-made Moms gift, we have engraved some heartwarming words on the recipe stand to express our love for our mothers. You can use cookbook holder as gifts for mom,mother,mum,mummy,grandma to express your gratitude . This is a gift from daughter and son to mother and can be used as Moms birthday gifts Moms Christmas gifts. Wide range of use: Based on the stable design of this bamboo book stand, it can withstand something of various sizes and styles.As a wood reading stand, it is a good choice to place magazines, drawing paper, documents, music scores, tabulations,Laptops, etc.At the same time, this book stand can be easily used in offices, libraries, kitchens, living rooms, indoors or outdoors, etc., especially as cookbook holders and stands for kitchen, it will better provide you with a reading stand. Lightweight and easy to carry: The simple but complete design makes it not only suitable for home use, but also suitable for travel and outing. This cook book iPad holder and table book stand can help you relax and enjoy better during the journey.Easy to fold down when not applicable. The appropriate size can be easily put into a medium or large bag that you carry with you. Adjustable angle: This is a humanized design. The adjustable bookshelf with 5 different angles can be changed anytime and anywhere according to your needs, so that you can use it comfortably when reading, working or cooking without damage Back, shoulders or neck. Let you keep reading in the correct posture, live a healthy life, and stay away from pain. Eco-friendly and durable:This wood reading stand is made of environmentally friendly bamboo materials and is equipped with a strong front tray. The back bracket forms a stable triangle with the board surface, so it can withstand books of various sizes and styles. At the same time, two powerful \"arms\" extend on the front tray, which can fix your book pages and free your hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719MhrTL45L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vakuny","source_asin":"B08TSZ4WDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TSZ4WDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TSZ4WDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1129585,"name":"Polar Bear Cubs by The Macneil Studio, 14x14-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wazw-E8QL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a polar bear and her two cubs cuddling in the snow. Richard Macneil, a self taught artist, formed The Macneil Studio in 2009 with his wife Judi and their sons Daniel and Kyle. Born in Winchester, Macneil started his working life as an artist at Worcester Royal Porcelain and has always worked in the fields of sculpture, ceramics, and illustration, both in the UK and internationally. He spent many years living on the east coast of the USA, then returned to Worcestershire and freelanced as an artist and greeting card designer. Richard spends any spare time he has with his family walking in the beautiful British countryside and fishing. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wazw-E8QL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B0719L4XR3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0719L4XR3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0719L4XR3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
