window.products.push({"id":1129771,"name":"LaVenty Set of 12 Rose Gold FEYONCE Balloons Bachelorette Party Decor Feyonce Party Decoration Engagement Balloon Proposal Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SdDegrUzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"You can inflate them by yourself. Find the filling tab on the outside of your balloon. Insert a drinking straw into the tab to help you blow it up. Pinch the straw and filling tab so air doesn't come out as you inflate it. Blow into the end of the straw to fill the balloon with air. Remove the straw and pinch the seal to close it up. The letter balloons are not made to float with helium! It can easily hooked through through the holes on the tabs. The Feyonce letter balloon is an awesome and perfect decoration for a wedding, engagement, valentine's day, bridal shower and many more. It is also an excellent accessory for photo shoots. Package Included: 16\" letter balloons spelling out FEYONCE (non-floating balloons), 10 x rose gold balloons, 1 x 30 inch Ring balloon. We care about customers’ shopping experience and try to offer the best service to you. We will send you a free replacement or a full refund within the first 30 days once you are not completely satisfied with our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SdDegrUzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LaVenty","source_asin":"B07XTD6H7Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XTD6H7Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XTD6H7Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1129772,"name":"Homajor Lift Chairs Recliners for Elderly,Recliner Chairs for Adults,Recliner Chair,Lift Chair with Massage and Heating Functions,Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":521.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-H9330ZsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Power Lift Recliner Chair】: This recliner chair’s tilt forward or recline is powered by electric motor, with wired control, you can simply press the up and down buttons to adjust the ideal reclining position. The whole process is quiet and smooth, the operation is simple and easy, which can be easily used by people of all ages. Suitable for living room, bedroom, home theater or even your office. 【Thick Padded & Soft Cushion】: The whole body of this power lift recliners for elderly is designed with thick and highly-elastic cushions, surface material is made of premium soft PU leather, the whole design gives comfort and support for your neck, back and lumbar. You can better enjoy your favorite TV shows or rest, provides you with excellent using experience. 【8 Point Massage & Lumbar Heating】: This electric recliner come with 4 vibrating massage parts total 8 points and 1 lumbar heating function. Available in 5 adjustable modes and 3 different intensities. You can set different modes according to your needs to relieve lumbar discomfort and get rid of stress and tiredness, give yourself a fully body relaxation. 【Smart Designs】: This power lift chair has 2 cup holders to put your water and drinks, 2 side storage pockets to keep remotes and other small items, thoughtful and humanized designs to provides more convenience for your daily life, a nice choice to replace normal living room chairs for taking a rest or watching TV, reading on bedroom, living room. 【Quick And Easy Assemble】: This reclining chair comes in 2 boxes, all parts and instruction are included. First, take all the parts out; second, slip the backrest and armrests onto the base; third, connect the cables. The whole process is super easy and only needs 10-15mins, no tools required. If you have any question about the item, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-H9330ZsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homajor","source_asin":"B0BXN9V3Q4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129772","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXN9V3Q4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXN9V3Q4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1129773,"name":"Ewbank EPV1100 4-in-1 Floor Cleaner, Scrubber, Polisher and Vacuum, Red Finish, 23-Foot Power Cord","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tLG3xGJsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Ewbank EPV1100 4-in-1 Floor Cleaner, Scrubber, Polisher and Vacuum delivers a complete floor cleaning solution. The EPV1100 is suitable for all floor types, including laminate, wood, vinyl, marble and granite. The easy to maneuver design is perfect for living rooms, kitchens and other medium to large spaces. Constructed of high impact material that is built to last, the polisher cleans and polishes a 9.5-inch path and delivers 2,200-rpm on the contra-rotating discs that are capable of cleaning, scrubbing and polishing your hard floors to a beautiful shine. The cyclonic vacuum detaches from the polishing unit for vacuuming hard floors before or after polishing. The 23-foot long power cord provides extra mobility. Other features include a 680-Watt Cyclonic Bagless HEPA Vacuum Filter, onboard cord storage area, telescopic handle and a butterfly grip for extra stability. The EPV1100 includes (2) nylon bristle scrubbing brush plates, (2) hook and loop backing plates and (3) pairs of interchangeable and reusable microfiber cleaning and polishing pads and (1) vacuum head, to keep your natural floors looking beautiful. The EPV1100 is non damaging to delicate floors. The Ewbank EPV1100 4-in-1 Floor Cleaner, Scrubber. Ewbank has been providing innovative cleaning solutions for an impressive 125-years. Innovative design, reliability and customer satisfaction are always top priority, making Ewbank a staple in most households. Ewbank's multi-purpose products, including floor polishers, vacs and steam cleaning solutions are all offered at affordable prices, meaning that Ewbank is always the practical solution to everyday cleaning. From the Manufacturer The Ewbank Floor Polisher and Vac offers the complete solution- a vacuum and floor polisher all in one. It is compact and easy to store and comes with additional accessories to provide great versatility when cleaning all types of bare floors. When used with Ewbank Floor Polish it brings a professional, high sheen finish to floors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tLG3xGJsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ewbank","source_asin":"B004X58PV4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004X58PV4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004X58PV4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1129774,"name":"Costa Nova Ceramic Stoneware 10'' Oval Platter - Brisa Collection, Ria Blue | Microwave, Dishwasher, Oven & Freezer Safe Dinnerware | Food Safe Glazin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pURzLTuOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STONEWARE PLATTERS - Coated with a reactive glaze, this dinnerware is safe to use in the microwave, dishwasher, oven, and freezer, but hand washing is advised for those larger and more delicate pieces ELEGANT TABLEWARE - The ria blue oval platter measures 9.5'' x 3.75'' in diameter and 1'' deep, all while being scratch resistant with wonderful workmanship and great color NATURALLY MADE - Each piece of serveware is made from the best natural resources in Portugal and is created through a single firing system to create a special bond between the clay and glazed surface BRISA COLLECTION - The blended white and blue glazes and organic shapes transport us to the intricate landscape of lagoons, canals, salt works, and sandy beaches stretching across deserted islands, this collection adds light to every gathering and turns any table into a memorable experience COSTA NOVA - The love of life, family, friends and good food has inspired the creation of fine stoneware collections combining quality and design with the best in ceramic craftsmanship. The brand produces innovative and sustainable stoneware, made from the best natural resources in Portugal while embracing “handmade” and preserving our European heritage in bringing to the table and home unique and elegant pieces that suit perfectly in today’s way of living and are able to last for generations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pURzLTuOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Costa Nova","source_asin":"B086VQF93D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086VQF93D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086VQF93D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
