window.products.push({"id":1129791,"name":"2 Pairs Training Chopsticks Non-Slippery Reusable Trainers or Learner for Beginners (Pink,Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ameTdKMFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy to Use】The set includes 2 pairs of dinosaur training chopsticks, pink + green. Lightweight, portable and reusable. When using, just insert the thumb, index finger and middle finger into the corresponding holes in turn, which is suitable for beginners. 【Open Mouth Dinosaur】When our dinosaur training chopsticks are in use, the dinosaur mouth at the top will follow the fingers to make corresponding bite movements. The fun design allows children to enjoy eating. 【Safe Materials】Safe food grade PP material, BPA free, can come into contact with food. The whole is round and smooth, and children are more assured to eat. 【Automatic Rebound】 The head of the learning chopsticks is equipped with an automatic rebound component. After the chopsticks are opened, they will automatically spring back to the original position, with moderate elasticity, which can exercise the child's hand strength. 【Non-Slip Design】The bottom of the training chopsticks is designed with groove patterns, this anti-slip design can help children pick up all kinds of smooth food and make eating more efficient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ameTdKMFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funvalley Surperfect","source_asin":"B0B23XJ24D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B23XJ24D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B23XJ24D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1129792,"name":"Natural Choice Incense Gift Pack with Wooden Incense Holder (6 Fragrances) Lavender, Sandalwood, Frankincense, Rose, Passion and Exotic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610icNybI4L._AC_SL1359_.jpg","description":"Our multi pack includes Passion, Rose, Lavender, Exotic, Loban and Sandalwood plus a free wooden incense holder. Each of these scents are made with natural ingredients with no chemicals. For generations incense has been used for spiritual practices and to ensure calming scents in sacred spaces around the world. Many practitioners use incense during therapy, a relaxing massage, or for meditation to help those present be at peace. Whether at home or in the studio, incense is just what you need for deep relaxation. Looking for the perfect way to keep your home, yoga or massage studio smelling wonderful? This premium set is just the solution. Incense is a natural, organic way to fill any space with pleasant yet not overpowering aroma. To use, simply light the tip of the incense stick, ensure the flame has caught, then blow it out. The tip will glow a warm red and emit an almost invisible smoke that will gently spread the fragrance as it slowly smolders. We are dedicated to producing natural herbal and resin incense for all to enjoy. Burn our high-quality incense and you’ll love the cozy vibe and pleasant aroma it provides.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610icNybI4L._AC_SL1359_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Natural Choice Incense","source_asin":"B078W2KTFG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078W2KTFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078W2KTFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
