window.products.push({"id":1129824,"name":"Le Creuset Silicone Pinch Bowl (Set of 4), 2 oz, Cerise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EXAozR4-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether measuring and staging loose ingredients before cooking or serving sauces, dips, and salsas on the side at dinner, this set of four 1/4-cup Silicone pinch bowls adds color, convenience, and versatility to any countertop or table. Crafted from stain-resistant, non-abrasive Silicone, the bowls resists odor and flavor absorption and can withstand heat up to 482 degrees F (250 degrees C). They're also safe to use in the microwave, oven, refrigerator, and freezer. Available in black and white, single-colored, or multi-colored, the pinch bowls provide countless uses in the kitchen and at the table. And like all Le Creuset Silicone, the bowls clean up easily with a simple cycle through the dishwasher. Stacked together, the bowls measure approximately 2-2/5 by 2-2/5 by 4-1/2 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EXAozR4-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B001P5GIYG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129824","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001P5GIYG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001P5GIYG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
