window.products.push({"id":1129959,"name":"Helix Sleep Ultra-Cool Pillow - Pillows for Sleeping - Cooling Pillow - King and Standard Sizes - Set of 1 Pillow - 100% Cotton & Down Alternative Pil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t13MZM7HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COOL TECHNOLOGY: Pillows get hot easily because most of the heat from your body escapes from your head. With a 100% cotton outer fabric, the Helix Ultra-Cool pillows are designed to be breathable and they feature a phase change material that absorbs and regulates heat to keep hot sleepers cool. COOL TO THE TOUCH: The Helix Ultra-Cool Pillow has a cool touch to keep you relaxed and help you fall asleep when you first get into bed. See the technology work right before your eyes, as the pillow's color changes to white when you place your hand on it! HOT SLEEPERS & HOT FLASHES: You don’t want to just fall asleep; you want to stay asleep. It can help hot sleepers and hot flashes because the phase change material is designed to regulate temperature throughout the night. This means it can handle sudden drastic increases in your body temperature. THE DETAILS: When laying flat on your bed, the Ultra-Cool Pillow is 6-8 inches high. We recommend giving the pillow a day or two to pop up to its full plumpness. All Helix products are made in the USA and packaged freshly after production. We never resell opened boxes or used products. Sizing: Standard- 20” x 28”, King- 20” x 36” THE HELIX DIFFERENCE: We celebrate that everyone is built and sleeps differently. At Helix, we create high-quality pillows and mattresses suitable for all sleepers. That means less pain and deeper sleep. Discover your perfect pillow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t13MZM7HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Helix","source_asin":"B07JVKJVB7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JVKJVB7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JVKJVB7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1129960,"name":"Gerard Puvis Collection Rectangular 12-Inch by 16-Inch Glass Serving Plate,\"Tribute To Wine\" by Gerard Puvis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OkALAGCPL._AC_.jpg","description":"An elegant glass serving plate from the Gerard Puvis Collection. We have reproduced images of his original sculptures on our entertaining products. His works are magical 3D sculptures made out of wine foils (the capsule that covers the cork on the top of a wine bottle) from the finest French vineyards. Each one comes to life at the hand of this famous French wine artist. The originals are commissioned and are in private collections throughout Europe and the US.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OkALAGCPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gerard Puvis Collection","source_asin":"B003INDAO4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003INDAO4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003INDAO4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1129961,"name":"Signature Housewares Party Plates with Caddy, Moroccan Design, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rYJ0Vb-rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stacked neatly in a hand-crafted, wrought-iron serving caddy, this fun set of six stoneware plates by Signature Housewares is an entertaining essential. The colorful, vibrant, Moroccan design compliments a wide variety of decor styles and can be used for multiple purposes. Constructed of glazed stoneware - a dense, strong, and durable ceramic that is especially appropriate for functional ware - each plate measures 6-inch in diameter and is microwave- and dishwasher-safe. Convenient caddy makes for attractive presentation and handy storage. Unit measures 7-1/2 x 7 x 6-inch overall and is packaged in an attractive gift box. Choose from a variety of designs and coordinate your look with a wide range of Signature Housewares dinnerware, serving pieces and accessories. Signature Housewares - fashionable, functional products that combine exceptional value and quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rYJ0Vb-rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Signature","source_asin":"B007UE3DZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007UE3DZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007UE3DZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1129962,"name":"El Paso Designs Mexican Yoga Blanket - 51 x 74 inches - Colorful Studio Mexican Falsa Blanket - Ideal for Yoga, Camping, Picnic, Beach Blanket, Beddin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1MPa6O2HML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Acrylic Imported TRADITIONAL HAND-MADE QUALITY: Carefully crafted by Mexican artisans located in Tlaxcala, Mexico, each tassel is individually hand-tied to produce a high-quality authentic Mexican Yoga Blanket. These blankets are soft, thick, and available in a wide variety of vivid colors. MEASUREMENTS & MATERIALS: Our authentic Mexican yoga blanket measures approximately 51 x 74 inches and is woven from a blend of soft environmentally friendly recycled fibers. MULTIPLE USES: Improve your yoga practice with our Falsa blanket for use over your yoga mat as a yoga blanket, yoga bolster, or meditation blanket. This blanket can be used indoors/outdoors and is ideal for the beach, camping, picnics, a twin bedspread, southwestern throw, accent throw, saddle blanket, home decor, car seat covers, or outdoor blanket. WASHING INSTRUCTIONS: Hand or machine wash in cold water on a gentle cycle. Hang to dry or tumble dry with low heat; Do Not Bleach. GIFT: The perfect gift for any occasion such as birthdays, holidays, graduations, stocking stuffers, or Christmas. Adults, children, and pets love the blanket evenly for it’s undeniable comfortability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1MPa6O2HML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"El Paso Designs","source_asin":"B075DNLL8X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075DNLL8X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075DNLL8X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1129963,"name":"Legare 29-Inch PDA Accessory Shelf, Expresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31dH0BFXQXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description 29\" Accessory Shelf in espresso finish, fits on any Legaré Desk, Bridge, Extension or Peninsula Amazon.com A fresh take on modular furniture, Legaré offers stylish curvilinear designs crafted of materials that assemble and rearrange with unparalleled ease. In just three minutes or less with no tools, screws, or bolts needed, individual components lock snugly together to become sturdy, stable office and home pieces that will provide many years of high-quality service. Legaré's Select line is made of engineered composite wood with solid-wood surface veneers. Engineered wood, manmade from small wood pieces and adhesives, has several environmental advantages: large panels of wood can be made from small-diameter trees; the use of wood scraps and wood with defects reduces waste; and engineered products are often stronger and less prone to warping from humidity than solid timber. Plus, all the wood Legaré uses is certified by the Forest Stewardship Council. This 29-inch PDA accessory shelf adds handy storage to any Legaré desk, bridge, extension, or peninsula. It slides onto the back riser to stow small portables such as cell phones, pagers, and media players within easy reach, and it sits high enough for CD jewel boxes to stand below it. The shelf also has a rear corner cutout for concealed cable management. Available in an ash veneer with an Espresso finish and oak veneer with a Wheat finish, the shelf measures 6.5 inches deep by 9.85 inches high and requires only one minute to assemble and a few seconds to disassemble. All Legaré furniture is backed by a three-year warranty. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31dH0BFXQXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Legar","source_asin":"B0019D1H3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0019D1H3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0019D1H3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
