window.products.push({"id":1129999,"name":"Winsome Bora Occasional Table, Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ccjxx2j6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of contemporary and unique styling to your entryway or dining room with the Bora Console Table. The clean lines, open shelves, and inset side panels on the center drawer combine to create a simple, refreshing alternative to traditional design. Place a lamp or vase on the table top and still have plenty of room in the drawer for keeping keys, gloves, or personal electronic devices. Use the open shelves for collectibles or more storage space. The console is also ideal in the dining room for keeping and displaying serve ware. Finished in a rich Walnut, this durable table is made of solid and composite wood. Overall table size is 40\"W x 15.9\"D x 29.9\"H.The console features a center drawer with a rectangular cut-out handle. The deep drawer offers ample storage, while the lowered side panels allow for a quick look to see what's inside. Open shelves at each end of the table give you more storage and display options. Assembly required. Overall table size is 40\"W x 15.9\"D x 29.9\"HInside drawer dimensions 12.9\"W x 13.9\"D x 8.9\"H - side panels: 6.3\"HShelf dimensions 9.4\"W x 8.9\"H (from the front) and 14.3\"W x 8.9\"H (from the side)Ships in 1 box","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ccjxx2j6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winsome","source_asin":"B01BNN6E70","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1129999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BNN6E70","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BNN6E70","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1130000,"name":"National Tree Company Artificial Christmas Tree, Champagne Gold Tinsel, Includes Stand, 7 feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TORXa26lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform your home into a winter wonderland with National Tree Company's Artificial Christmas Tree. This Tinsel tree is 7 feet tall and has a 24 inch diameter base, creating a slimmer profile and making it a better option for those with limited space. Friends and family alike will marvel at how the tree closely mimics those outside. Made to look and feel lifelike, the stunning realism of the tree is defined by its close attention to detail, featuring hundreds of individually crafted branch tips that make up the wide, full-bodied branches that create space for your lights and ornaments. The tree is designed with a hinged branch system that allows the branches to swing down for a quick and simple set-up and fold back in for easy storage. Set aside 45-60 minutes after assembly to properly shape the tree by peeling back the branches and pulling the tips apart to give the branches a more full-bodied look. Once the tree is fluffed to your liking, weave your desired lights through the branches starting from the top and moving down towards the bottom. Before dressing the tree in twinkling lights and glistening ornaments, consider placing it in a living room or dining area where it can be viewed from multiple angles and does not block any entryways. Constructed with sturdy, high quality materials and hypo-allergenic, fire-resistant needles, this tree is built to bring holiday cheer for years to come. At National Tree Company, we strive to create high quality Christmas decorations to help you transform your home so you can keep making every holiday moment magical.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TORXa26lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"National Tree Company","source_asin":"B074D8G7TS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074D8G7TS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074D8G7TS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1130001,"name":"Sivaphe Large Cold Brewer Coffee Maker 2 Quart, Dishwasher Safty Manual Traitan Pitcher Leak Proof, 64 oz Iced Coffee Tea Method Brewer with Deluxe Re","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613mQpRRTRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Leak-proof and Practicality--The Sivaphe Cold Brew Coffee Maker is a durable BPA-Free Tritan pitcher with an airtight lid and non-slip silicone handle. Cold brew suit for the different size refrigerators. It produces smooth cold beverage with any type of coffee grounds and tea. Large Superfine Filtration System--Making the finest cold brew maker and iced tea maker requires innovative technology. At Sivaphe, we use superfine Filter, This creates an ultra fine filtration system that allows water to steep your coarse cold brew coffee grounds while keeping unwanted flavors and bitterness out. Easy to use--Effortlessly make delicious cold coffee brew with the amazing Sivaphe cold coffee brewer. Simply add coffee, steep overnight and drink. Warm gift for father's day. Easy to clean--The components of Sivaphe cold brew are all removable. Clean up is quick and simple and all components are dishwasher safe, nice gift for her and him easy lifestyle. MONEY BACK PROMISE-- If for any reason you are not satisfied with our high quality espresso maker, you will receive your money within the first 30 days without any ifs and buts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613mQpRRTRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sivaphe","source_asin":"B09BTLY8YK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BTLY8YK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BTLY8YK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
